sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Strategy (evaluate)
    participant R as EvaluateLeg (pure)
    participant MD as MarketData
    participant X as Executor
    participant D as Deribit
    participant SM as StateManager
    participant J as orders.log

    S->>MD: refreshMarks (mid + greeks per position)
    S->>R: EvaluateLeg(pos, now, rules)
    Note over R: priority: stop-loss → DTE roll → delta drift → ROI take-profit
    R-->>S: RolloutDecision

    alt stop-loss (loss ≥ stop_loss_multiplier × premium)
        S->>X: Submit buy MARKET (high priority, bypasses breaker)
        X->>D: private/buy
        D-->>X: filled_amount
    else roll (DTE / delta drift / ROI)
        S->>MD: GetInstrument → ask
        S->>X: Submit buy LIMIT @ ask, immediate_or_cancel
        X->>D: private/buy
        D-->>X: filled_amount (final: IOC never rests)
    end

    S->>J: LogClose(closed part, P&L in coin + USD)
    alt fully closed
        S->>SM: RemovePosition + RemoveStrangleContaining
    else partial fill
        S->>SM: UpdatePositionQty(remaining) — stop-loss still protects it
        Note over S: the rule fires again next cycle
    end

    Note over S,SM: Reopening is not part of the exit
    alt one leg rolled (strangle now one-legged)
        S->>S: repairIncompleteStrangles → same expiry, entry delta, size (GEX-gated)
    else both legs gone
        S->>S: slot is free → maybeOpenStrangles opens a fresh strangle
    end
